{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e16-scene-02",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "淳于总晕倒了  (Crisis News and Chun Yuqiao's Collapse)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "crew": "场务"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Welcome to Episode 16 of Behind the Scenes. Stuck in traffic with livestream equipment trouble, Kaiwen calls Bu Xiaogu right before urgent news arrives from overseas—and Xiaogu finds Chun Yuqiao collapsed on his office floor. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "小谷，刚才我欧洲的朋友告诉我，他们那边确认了，是恐怖袭击。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "他们那边那个发布会待会儿就开了，我现在大堵车，完全动不了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "而且直播设备那边，还出点问题。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "凯文哥，你等下。喂，你好！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "被法国人领养的弟弟，在袭击里失踪了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "他法国家人说，他去了其中一处爆炸现场。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总！淳于总！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总晕倒了，很严重，在办公室，也不知道多久了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "放在原地千万不要动，我马上过来！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "小谷，刚才我欧洲的朋友告诉我，他们那边确认了，是恐怖袭击。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xiaogu, my friend in Europe just told me they confirmed over there that it was a terrorist attack.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "他们那边那个发布会待会儿就开了，我现在大堵车，完全动不了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Their press conference starts shortly, and I am stuck in a massive traffic jam unable to move at all.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "而且直播设备那边，还出点问题。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'On top of that, there is a glitch with the livestream equipment.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "凯文哥，你等下。喂，你好！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hold on a second, Kaiwen. Hello!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "被法国人领养的弟弟，在袭击里失踪了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'His younger brother adopted by a French family went missing in the attack.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "他法国家人说，他去了其中一处爆炸现场。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'His family in France says he went to one of the explosion sites.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总！淳于总！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Chun Yuqiao! Mr Chun Yuqiao!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总晕倒了，很严重，在办公室，也不知道多久了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Chun Yuqiao fainted in his office—it looks serious, and I do not know how long he has been down!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "放在原地千万不要动，我马上过来！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Leave him right where he is and do not move him—I am coming over immediately!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "小谷，刚才我欧洲的朋友告诉我，他们那边确认了，是恐怖袭击。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "他们那边那个发布会待会儿就开了，我现在大堵车，完全动不了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "而且直播设备那边，还出点问题。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "凯文哥，你等下。喂，你好！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "被法国人领养的弟弟，在袭击里失踪了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "他法国家人说，他去了其中一处爆炸现场。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总！淳于总！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总晕倒了，很严重，在办公室，也不知道多久了！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "放在原地千万不要动，我马上过来！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "With Chun Yuqiao unconscious from exhaustion and stomach bleeding, Bu Xiaogu scrambles to get emergency medical help on site. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "再见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
